@startuml
title State diagram for BPO Management System Search Criteria

[*] --> InitialState : Start

state "Initial" as InitialState
InitialState : entry / start state

state "Filter by Category" as FilterCategory
FilterCategory : entry / selected category filter
FilterCategory : do / display matching users based on category

state "Filter by Price Range" as FilterPriceRange
FilterPriceRange : entry / selected price range filter
FilterPriceRange : do / display matching users based on price range

InitialState --> FilterCategory : Select Category Filter
InitialState --> FilterPriceRange : Select Price Range Filter

FilterCategory --> FilterPriceRange : Change to Price Range Filter
FilterPriceRange --> FilterCategory : Change to Category Filter

FilterCategory --> [*] : Clear Filters
FilterPriceRange --> [*] : Clear Filters

@enduml
